    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Removed the conflicting late FF8 panel overrides that caused blue right panes, transparent captions with border lines through the text, and case-by-case Detail geometry. FF8 Detail rows now share one fixed label/value division, Weapons uses the shared row structure, and fitted tables measure their actual rendered rows so the border ends with the content instead of clipping it. Fresh rendered checks cover Items, Magic, GFs, Shops, and Weapons; the broader cross-plugin Detail migration remains actionable.",
